WEBVTT

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:05.980
<b>Several Decades Ago</b>

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.180
Hurry, hurry!

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.220
<i>Hello, everyone!</i>

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.470
<i>I'm Tanaka Sayori, age 14.</i>

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.150
<i>Sign, Taurus. Blood type B.</i>

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>For breakfast, I always eat Japanese food.</i>

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:20.530
Aw, Mom! You put jam on my white rice!

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:20.490
<b>The staff ate this later</b>

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.430
I wish toast-eaters would 
all just vanish forever!

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:26.370
Huh?

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.370
Hey, isn't that...

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:31.160
My crush, Uno-kun?

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.120
I can't see...

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:38.860
If there are cyborgs in this 
world, let them come to me!

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:40.250
That is all!

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.400
<i>He said it so sincerely.</i>

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.590
<i>He had an eccentric charm that 
rendered the entire class speechless.</i>

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:50.610
I told you, hand over the cash!

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.610
<i>Maybe I should talk to him!</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.830
You deaf or somethin'?

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:54.100
<i>But it looks like he's talking 
to friends right now...</i>

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.500
Fairy of courage, please...

00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:59.990
Please, grant me the power!

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:03.610
You called?

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:07.550
<i>Uh, I accidentally summoned a yakuza.</i>

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.500
The holder is hereby certified as a fairy.
<b>Kokoro-chan
</b>Ministry of Fairy Authorization: Fairy
Authorized to name magical girls
Authorized to bestow Love Power
Earthling Disguise Certification: Grade 7
Fairy Writing Certification: Grade Pre-1 
Fairy C'est la Vie Certification: Grade 2

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:14.550
<b>Fairy License</b>

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:12.390
By the way, this is who I am.

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.540
You really are a fairy?

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:19.110
Now that you mention it, you 
do have a rather cute face...

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.560
I know, right?

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:23.760
Your Love Power called me here.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.780
You got a problem or somethin'?

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:28.740
Are you going to help me?

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.810
The truth is, I can't speak 
to the man I love...

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.890
The guy's getting harassed.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:41.260
He's pretty stubborn, huh, Yocchan?

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:42.410
All right...

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:43.530
Take this!

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:46.950
V-Violence?

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.940
Even if they are friends, that's too much!

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.910
Yeah, I don't think they're friends...

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.460
That's right, Mr. Fairy!

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.530
Give them an educational reprimand!

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.880
<b>Educational Reprimand</b>

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.090
You want missing fingers or concrete 
shoes? Pick one, dammit.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:04.680
No way, no way. I'm super weak. 
I go down with one punch.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.500
This guy's so useless.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.020
What's with this girl? She's super rude.

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:13.750
<i>I'd like to save Uno-kun 
myself, if I could...</i>

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:15.370
<i>But...</i>

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:18.860
<i>I'm but a fragile maiden.</i>

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.240
<i>If I tried to interfere,</i>

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:25.390
<i>I'd end up getting that humiliating act 
forced upon me, like in a late-night anime.</i>

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:28.590
What's with this girl? 
She's super imaginative.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:29.570
It's off-putting.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.370
If only I could use magic...

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:37.100
I could become so super-macho and 
mega-strong they couldn't beat me!

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:39.580
You can.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.340
Wanna?

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:42.600
Yes!

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.680
I've never seen anyone agree that quick!

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:50.700
Now that I look, you're 
kind of a cutie, kiddo.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:54.330
How's about we force something 
on you that'll get the PTA—

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:58.890
I mean, the city of Tokyo—declarin' 
this "unwholesome media"?

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:03.200
An act that'll get our show 
declared "adult only"!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.700
We'll open a hole in the wall!

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.240
Hold it!

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:09.570
Who's there?

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.330
Just a passer-by!

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:21.860
<i>A deviant!</i>

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:23.560
Even if...

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:26.360
you are friends...

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.360
violence is unacceptable!

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:35.530
Who are you?

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:38.960
I'm Tanaka Sayori.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.190
Tanaka Sayori?

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:43.700
You mean, from my class?

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.050
Yes. You may fall in love with me.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:53.670
<i>And that's how Saki's parents, 
the Unos, fell in love.</i>

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:29.300
Huh? Who's that?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:33.550
You know... Mohiro-chan's idol partner...

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:35.390
He's got a partner?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:36.970
You really don't know who we mean?

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:39.030
Who the hell is he, dammit?!

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:44.480
We don't know who he is! That's 
why we wanted your help!

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:47.590
You want a background check, 
it'll cost ya extra, dammit.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.600
Please, help us!

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.900
Our existence as magical 
girls could be riding on it!

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:57.920
Fine, I'll give it a try.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.550
He doesn't know Hyoe-san?

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:03.590
I guess that could happen, huh?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.550
You think?

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:09.690
<i>We've realized that Hyoe is even more suspect.</i>

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:16.820
<i>So we've decided to see what Hyoe 
and Mohiro-chan get up to all day.</i>

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:22.770
<b>Magical Girl - Stalking</b>

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.780
Stare...

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:28.200
Hey, this is just like last episode.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.180
He's gonna make his move.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:32.210
Until then, we just wait him out!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:35.970
It's like a stakeout scene from those
 now-obsolete cop dramas.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.210
Should I buy us some milk and anpan?

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.200
We're covered!

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:44.450
<i>That's right... we know nothing about Hyoe.</i>

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:47.430
<i>He showed up around 
Mohiro-chan out of the blue.</i>

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.830
<i>He became friends with 
Mohiro-chan out of the blue.</i>

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:53.310
<i>Then he dragged Mohiro-chan into the 
entertainment industry out of the blue!</i>

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:03.850
Well, this time, if I keep watch over him,

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:07.870
I'm sure he'll do something 
suspicious to show his true face!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.970
H-Hey, are you Hyoe-san?

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:28.060
Oh, people make that mistake a lot.

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:30.460
Wow, do I really look that much like him?

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.780
They've just kind of been...

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:48.100
flirting the whole friggin' day!

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.490
M-Ma'am!

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:53.010
I never knew detective 
work could be so painful!

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.650
M-Ma'am?

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:58.250
She's fine. It's a chronic condition.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.750
<b>Ramen</b>

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:05.040
At this rate, I'll be 
shaming my grandfather.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:08.720
Isn't your grandfather just a normal 
old man who loves gateball?

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:10.500
Yeah, but still!

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:16.460
<b>Ramen</b>

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:15.000
They're going around that corner!

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.130
We need to watch out for places 
where they might be alone!

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.100
We're comin' in!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.530
Heh heh heh! He's a cutie pie!

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:26.680
I'm calling for help!

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:28.830
But we already paid him.

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:30.620
Don't even try to resist.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:34.200
Stop! You're going to have your way with 
me, aren't you? Like in a porn doujin!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.720
We'll show you the true demon world.

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:38.290
S-Stop it!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.380
N-No!

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:43.960
Saki?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.120
I know...

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:50.270
Let's kill Hyoe.

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.620
J-Jumping right to the last resort?

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.630
Y-You see,

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:59.020
if I die, my personal world will end,

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:02.860
which will mean the end 
of the world I know...

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:03.640
She's so disturbed, her mind has 
entered a realm I can't understand...

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.390
Hey, look!

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.530
O-Oh!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.620
Yeah, that makes sense.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:18.160
They have a child between them.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:21.530
Th-They had a child?!

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:22.780
So soon?!

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:24.400
Seriously, chill.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.360
Do you know where this 
child's mother might be?

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:30.620
Oh, I wouldn't know...

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:31.920
Would you like some candy?

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:38.930
<b>Educational measures</b>

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:34.330
He's just a lost child.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.060
Yes, I see.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.050
Are you calm now?

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:38.930
Yeah.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.600
It's going to get dark.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.020
I guess he won't make a move today.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.960
You think?

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:50.020
Huh?

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.050
Where's he going?

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.030
Going to call a police officer, maybe?

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.630
<i>Something feels off...</i>

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:10.930
Why, why does the crow cry?

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:18.230
The crow has a reason...

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:27.670
You see, off on the mountain

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.890
The Mohiro Kingdom grows once again!

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.310
Mohiro-chan...

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:33.750
She has seven beloved children

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:31.190
Oh Nii-san, really...

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:37.550
<i>Mohiro-chan's song really does 
have a mysterious power.</i>

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:44.070
<i>I hope even more people get 
to hear Mohiro-chan's song.</i>

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.340
I know, right?

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.340
Wh-Wha...

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:53.410
Oh, did you think I hadn't noticed you?

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:57.170
You'd better knock off the stalker 
stuff or you'll get arrested.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:03.270
Also, the jealous face you made whenever 
I got near Mohiro was way hilarious.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:04.750
Just super ugly.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:05.730
<i>You bastard...</i>

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.350
<i>I'll dig out your heart!</i>

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:09.330
What was that phone call?

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.490
Just some business.

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:18.470
Oh, but we've been searching for that child's 
mother. I think she'll be here soon enough.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:19.730
Look—

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.550
Later.

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:26.170
Right now, Mohiro is singing.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:37.770
About Mohiro... Are you sure he's really human?

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:39.770
Huh?

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:42.740
I mean, it's strange, isn't it?

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:44.830
It's like he has some kind of superpower.

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:46.750
It's hard to believe...

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:50.060
He's spacy all the time, too.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:55.950
I expect he's some weird kind of 
spirit or dwarf or something.

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:58.350
Huh? Um, wha...

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:02.530
The reason I got him into
the entertainment world

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:07.090
is because I wanted everyone to 
know how amazing his singing was.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:10.030
Like, "Isn't my son just great?"

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.370
Ah... I see.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.170
<i>He's acting like a proud papa.</i>

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:18.050
It's a lovely song, isn't it?

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:19.540
Mohiro's song...

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:25.710
Yeah...

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:31.770
It's true, Mohiro-chan does 
seem a little... otherworldly.

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.650
He's got some cryptid qualities, too.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.250
But the reason his song 
seems to attract people...

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:40.490
Bye-bye!

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.900
I think it's because he's so pure-hearted.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:47.870
That's right. I like that part of him, too.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.280
Is that why?

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.890
The reason the demons are after Mohiro...

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.990
The reason they're trying to 
take him to the demon world...

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:00.090
This time, I'm turning the question to you.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.230
Hyoe-san, are you really...

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:07.830
Are you really human?

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:13.030
An excellent question.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:28.950
<b>Present Day</b>

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.390
Hurry, hurry!

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:30.800
<i>Hiya, everyone!</i>

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:32.530
<i>I'm Yamo Konami.</i>

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:33.970
<i>My age is a secret.</i>

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:36.350
<i>My sign and blood type are also secret!</i>

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.330
<i>When it comes to dinner, I always 
eat convenience store food.</i>

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:43.050
Aw, stupid clerk! You forgot 
to put in my chopsticks!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:47.350
I wish inconsiderate clerks 
would all vanish forever!

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:49.840
<i>I'm a manager for a popular idol group.</i>

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:54.850
<i>Today, I'm going to teach you 
a little about my lifestyle.</i>

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:57.720
<i>Huh? Oh, who cares about 
the main plot anyway?</i>

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.650
I need to hurry or I'll be late!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.160
Is that...

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:12.070
The super-rare legendary staff illustration 
collection for <i>Magical Angel Creamy Mami</i>?!

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:17.040
To think I'd find such a treasure on 
my way back from the office!

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:21.110
Excuse me! I'd like to buy this!

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.990
Sir, don't be absurd.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.840
That's a super premium item.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.390
Pay me a million yen and 
I might think about—

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.640
10,000 yen

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.640
10,000 yen

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.640
10,000 yen

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:33.760
You're the absurd one here!

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.780
What do you think I work day and night for?!

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:38.660
It's for moments like these!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.620
F-Forgive me!

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:43.780
I'll get it wrapped up for you at once!

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:44.440
And make it snappy!

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.300
For heaven's sake...

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:49.190
I'm gonna be late for watching 
the MoroCure rebroadcast...

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:50.440
Fujimoto

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:57.820
Fujimoto

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:57.830
To think I would run into you here...

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.880
Y-You're...

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:01.710
<i>Um...</i>

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:03.580
<i>Who was he again?</i>

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:07.160
Think twice before you address me.

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:09.900
I'm currently on a secret mission.

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.840
Um... okay?

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:16.810
Yes... I have stealth functionality 
and other such amazing abilties,

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.310
which makes me absolutely 
perfect for this mission.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:19.840
<i>He just started monologuing about himself.</i>

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:21.280
<i>What's with this dude?</i>

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:27.940
My power, which enables me to defeat even 
robots 57 meters tall and weighing 550 tons...

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:24.600
<i>I'm pretty sure we've never met before...</i>

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:26.620
<i>But he's acting really familiar...</i>

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.530
<b>Disinterested</b>

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.100
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:30.670
Even so, you...

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:34.940
you still have interest in a classic 
like <i>Magical Angel Creamy Mami</i>?

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:37.530
You know <i>Creamy Mami</i>?!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:42.700
Of course! That melancholy idol magical girl 
that captured the hearts of women and girls!

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:46.020
Her cries of "Toshio" and that speaking 
voice! It was the best, wasn't it?

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:48.440
Calm down, calm down!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:51.660
Sorry, but I have no interest 
in that speaking voice!

00:15:51.680 --> 00:16:03.690
<b>Rumble Rumble</b>

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:57.030
No interest? Why didn't her 
enchanting voice seize your heart?

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:58.850
What? But you're the one who...

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.390
Forget about me.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.680
Next time you spout crap like that, 
I'll shove a Creamy Stick up your ass!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:07.950
You understand nothing about
the nuances of fan psychology!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.310
What's with this guy?

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:12.940
How can you not know the characters 
from such a popular show?

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:16.730
I'm not like some mass-produced extra 
character from an evil organization.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:20.450
<b>Rumble Rumble</b>

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.760
I'm not an extra!

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:20.450
W-Where did that come from?!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:25.490
Back off! <i>You're</i> the one who 
doesn't understand anything!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:26.030
Fujimoto

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:27.790
<i>He's scary!</i>

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.960
<i>I never know what hardcore 
otaku are thinking.</i>

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:32.810
Well, goodbye!

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:33.750
Hey, you!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.760
I'd better stay away from 
that store from now on!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:42.020
I managed to escape, but...

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:45.310
That was really scary.

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:48.150
And that took up a lot of time.

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.160
It's so late already!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:00.740
<i>If I hurry back, I should make it in time for
 Cure Cadmium Red's transformation scene.</i>

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:00.740
<b>Crouch start</b>

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:03.920
Yes... no more detours.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Naiagari</b>

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:06.940
Please support us!

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.950
We debuted last month!

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:11.060
<i>Street idols?</i>

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.800
Please listen!

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:12.780
<i>I've never seen those two before...</i>

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.380
Please! Just for a few minutes!

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:18.310
Please support us!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.340
Please support us!

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:21.810
Could we have a minute of your time?

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.040
Please listen to our single!

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:26.850
Please support us!

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.050
Excuse me.

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:30.810
I'll take one CD.

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.110
Really?

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.860
We seriously

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.860
Wanna Make It Big!!!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.060
No one's bought any before...

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:40.540
<i>A title that suggests incredible ambition.</i>

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.830
Thank you very much!

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:45.990
We finally sold one!

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.790
Yeah, finally...

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:52.450
<i>My love for idols was just an extension 
of my love for magical girls...</i>

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:55.300
<i>I really am in deep now, though.</i>

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.900
<i>But wow, that sure took me back...</i>

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:01.810
<i>We were doing the same thing 
not long ago, weren't we?</i>

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:23.320
<b>Magical Girls Album</b>

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:23.320
<b>Now on sale.</b>

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:22.670
<i>Now those two are top idols.</i>

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.870
<i>And they're magical girls.</i>

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.330
<i>There've been a lot of hard times...</i>

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:39.480
<i>But I'm glad I kept rooting for you.</i>

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:45.130
<i>You two really are my dream.</i>

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.550
<b>Designated for Pedestrians and Bicycles</b>

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:03.530
I'm in deep trouble!

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.450
I'm back!

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:14.840
Gosh, I didn't make it 
in time for MoroCure...

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:17.530
I'll have to make do with a recording.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.800
I guess they're fighting again...

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:28.490
Hey!

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:32.250
Darn it, you guys have no chill!

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.860
Hey, stop it!

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:44.410
I said, <i>stop it!</i>

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:48.240
For heaven's sake...

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:53.150
You could learn a thing or two from 
Saki-chan and Sakuyo-chan's friendship.

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:57.260
What's that?

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.230
Oh, really?

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:02.190
Really?

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:07.450
The ending's drawing near, is it?

00:21:41.790 --> 00:21:43.660
Our manager's the bad guy?!

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:47.920
Yes. We're in the same agency,

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:51.820
and it seems he's been conspiring 
to learn Mohiro's schedule.

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:54.080
See? This is a listening device.

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:57.000
I found it in Mohiro's bag recently.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.300
B-But...

00:21:58.300 --> 00:21:59.330
Huh?

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:01.370
But just a few minutes ago...

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:04.550
You had that super suggestive close-up! 
What was the point of that?

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:08.930
And you basically came out and said, 
"Yeah, I might not be human."

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.200
Oh, I know.

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:13.300
Call for your fairy, would you?

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:19.180
H-How d-d-do you know a-a-about that?

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:22.220
Just call him. Then it'll all make sense.

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:25.160
K-Kokoro-chan?

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:27.980
What the hell?

00:22:28.300 --> 00:22:32.490
I was just about to head to a 
sweets buffet with my FayFre—

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:32.490
<b>* FayFre = Fairy Friend</b>

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:35.090
Hey.

00:22:41.900 --> 00:22:43.430
K-Kokoro-chan?

00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:44.910
What's wrong with you?

00:22:44.910 --> 00:22:47.140
Did you finally acquire a vibrate function?

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:50.190
Y-You... You... You!

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:51.640
You!

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:56.220
Stick your faces on the 
ground right this instant!

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:58.220
Seriously, what's going on?!

00:22:58.220 --> 00:22:59.300
Don't you know?!

00:22:59.300 --> 00:23:00.980
This man is...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:04.230
He's the next King of the Fairies!

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:07.560
King of the Fairies?

00:23:08.260 --> 00:23:10.580
You mean, you're a prince?

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:13.270
Um, that's not the weird part...

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:15.740
Hi!

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:22.410
<i>Hey. I'm Sakuyo.</i>

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:26.240
<i>Saki and I have been together 
all this time, haven't we?</i>

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:27.800
<i>But...</i>

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:28.930
<i>Goodbye.</i>

00:23:29.620 --> 00:23:32.250
<i>Next time, "Magical Girl - Final Battle".</i>

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>CcMagical Girl - Final Battle</b>

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:34.300
<i>Make sure to watch it, okay?</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: Monokubo
